Steam from an underground spring?

1299
01:02:51,120 --> 01:02:53,120
No, no.

1300
01:02:53,120 --> 01:02:54,120
I'm not sure.

1301
01:02:54,120 --> 01:02:55,120
I'm not sure.

1302
01:02:55,120 --> 01:02:56,120
I'm not sure.

1303
01:02:56,120 --> 01:02:59,120
Steam from an underground spring?

1304
01:02:59,120 --> 01:03:00,120
Something hotter than that.

1305
01:03:00,120 --> 01:03:01,120
Fudge.

1306
