1316
01:03:17,120 --> 01:03:19,120
Mark 7, Mark 7.

1317
01:03:19,120 --> 01:03:21,120
Mark 7 Productions, Mark 7 Productions.

1318
01:03:21,120 --> 01:03:24,120
Eh, let's go to old mole town.

1319
01:03:24,120 --> 01:03:27,120
The Egyptians were able to weave very fine materials out of wool.

1320
01:03:27,120 --> 01:03:28,120
Jeez.

1321
