The stuff they're waving here looks like burlap.

1322
01:03:30,120 --> 01:03:33,120
The finer cloth is loomed by the priests.

1323
01:03:33,120 --> 01:03:34,120
One of their trade secrets.

1324
01:03:34,120 --> 01:03:36,120
So you read the brochure.

1325
01:03:36,120 --> 01:03:37,120
Big deal.

1326
01:03:37,120 --> 01:03:38,120
I'd like to get out of here.

1327
01:03:38,120 --> 01:03:40,120
But I'm not done droning yet.

1328
01:03:40,120 --> 01:03:43,120
And action.

1329
