1334
01:03:54,120 --> 01:03:56,120
Our position will soon come to naught.

1335
01:03:56,120 --> 01:03:58,120
But are these outsiders not divine?

1336
01:03:58,120 --> 01:04:00,120
No, they are mortal.

1337
01:04:00,120 --> 01:04:02,120
Do they not eat when they're hungry?

1338
01:04:02,120 --> 01:04:04,120
Do they not sleep when they are weary?

1339
01:04:04,120 --> 01:04:05,120
When the gods attack them.

1340
01:04:05,120 --> 01:04:09,120
Did not their faces show the fears of mortal men?

1341
01:04:09,120 --> 01:04:11,120
But do they not possess the power of heaven?

1342
01:04:11,120 --> 01:04:13,120
That's a good point, Gary.

1343
01:04:13,120 --> 01:04:15,120
