1344
01:04:15,120 --> 01:04:18,120
If you had that cylinder, or you, or you.

1345
01:04:18,120 --> 01:04:19,120
But not you, Tad.

1346
01:04:19,120 --> 01:04:20,120
You could use it too.

1347
01:04:20,120 --> 01:04:23,120
And if it is the power of heaven,

1348
01:04:23,120 --> 01:04:25,120
