1349
01:04:25,120 --> 01:04:29,120
And use it to control the beasts of the dark, the people, and...

1350
01:04:29,120 --> 01:04:30,120
Yes, if need be.

1351
01:04:30,120 --> 01:04:33,120
Even a faltering king himself.

1352
01:04:33,120 --> 01:04:36,120
Sir, what about the parallel parking resolution?

1353
01:04:36,120 --> 01:04:39,120
You will therefore follow these intruders

1354
01:04:39,120 --> 01:04:41,120
