1384
01:05:51,120 --> 01:05:52,120
with a Harvard accent

1385
01:05:52,120 --> 01:05:55,120
and playing baseball in front of the Temple of Ishtar.

1386
01:05:55,120 --> 01:05:58,120
The Ishtar and I in champions is a little mushroom.

1387
01:05:58,120 --> 01:06:01,120
Look out, Harold Lloyd is behind you.

1388
01:06:01,120 --> 01:06:02,120
Come on.

1389
01:06:02,120 --> 01:06:05,120
Glad I had my peripheral vision removed.

1390
01:06:05,120 --> 01:06:10,120
My plan is going swimmingly.

1391
