They're being transferred to the Hall of Goats.

1393
01:06:18,120 --> 01:06:23,120
You should never have goats and whipping in the same scene.

1394
01:06:23,120 --> 01:06:28,120
I had a burrow, like, from three miles over to get this job.

1395
01:06:28,120 --> 01:06:30,120
I'm not even sure it's worth it.

1396
01:06:30,120 --> 01:06:32,120
The mole people need Cesar Chavez.

1397
01:06:32,120 --> 01:06:33,120
All right, Ted.

1398
01:06:33,120 --> 01:06:35,120
Nothing personal, just the business.

1399
01:06:35,120 --> 01:06:38,120
Is all in order?

1400
01:06:38,120 --> 01:06:39,120
In order, Captain.

1401
01:06:39,120 --> 01:06:40,120
Shall I feed them?

1402
01:06:40,120 --> 01:06:41,120
They're getting weak.

1403
01:06:41,120 --> 01:06:43,120
You have your orders.

1404
01:06:43,120 --> 01:06:45,120
They're not to be fed until you're told otherwise.

1405
01:06:45,120 --> 01:06:47,120
Yes, Captain Fingerhead.

1406
01:06:47,120 --> 01:06:49,120
Man, I'm good at what I do.

1407
01:06:49,120 --> 01:06:52,120
Hi, can we borrow a goat?

1408
01:06:52,120 --> 01:06:57,120
There's been an alarming number of footballs

1409
