1410
01:06:59,120 --> 01:07:01,120
Gods, six-day lashes.

1411
01:07:01,120 --> 01:07:03,120
Make them long, beautiful Maybelline lashes.

1412
01:07:03,120 --> 01:07:06,120
It's always upsetting to see elves whipping.

1413
01:07:06,120 --> 01:07:07,120
Well...

1414
01:07:09,120 --> 01:07:11,120
Come on, I can take a brownie. I've done it before.

1415
01:07:11,120 --> 01:07:13,120
Please, don't interfere.

1416
01:07:13,120 --> 01:07:14,120
The Beast has committed a crime.

1417
01:07:14,120 --> 01:07:15,120
He was hungry.

1418
01:07:15,120 --> 01:07:17,120
My orders are to keep them hungry.

1419
01:07:17,120 --> 01:07:18,120
Captain, look.

1420
01:07:18,120 --> 01:07:20,120
There's a bathroom stall open now.

1421
01:07:20,120 --> 01:07:24,120
Do you realize you're bringing disaster on our heads?

1422
01:07:24,120 --> 01:07:25,120
And yours too?

1423
01:07:25,120 --> 01:07:28,120
Come on, people are pushed. You want some, huh?

1424
01:07:28,120 --> 01:07:32,120
I'm just so tense,

1425
01:07:32,120 --> 01:07:35,120
I'm going to go whittle some napkin rings to the lights.

1426
01:07:35,120 --> 01:07:37,120
Cassius, Anthony,

1427
01:07:37,120 --> 01:07:39,120
where's the Ides of March dinner?

1428
01:07:39,120 --> 01:07:42,120
There's sand up my skirt,

1429
01:07:42,120 --> 01:07:44,120
and I'm not wearing any underwear.

1430
01:07:44,120 --> 01:07:45,120
Oh, the pain.

1431
01:07:45,120 --> 01:07:50,120
I'd rather be in some dark hallow

1432
01:07:50,120 --> 01:07:52,120
Where the sun don't ever shine

1433
01:07:52,120 --> 01:07:53,120
Okay, that's good.

1434
01:07:53,120 --> 01:07:56,120
Brought you a big delicious pan of smarmy.

1435
01:07:56,120 --> 01:07:59,120
Boy, you're really bad.

1436
01:07:59,120 --> 01:08:01,120
Did you learn that song as a child?

1437
01:08:01,120 --> 01:08:02,120
I'm tuning it.

1438
01:08:02,120 --> 01:08:04,120
I did not learn it. I found it.

1439
01:08:04,120 --> 01:08:06,120
(singing)

1440
01:08:06,120 --> 01:08:07,120
It's beautiful.

1441
01:08:07,120 --> 01:08:09,120
As beautiful as you are.

1442
01:08:09,120 --> 01:08:12,120
No, I'm a marked one.

1443
01:08:12,120 --> 01:08:14,120
The priest said so.

1444
01:08:14,120 --> 01:08:15,120
They're so right.

1445
01:08:15,120 --> 01:08:16,120
You win.

1446
01:08:16,120 --> 01:08:17,120
It's okay.

1447
01:08:17,120 --> 01:08:19,120
It's not only the color of your eyes,

1448
01:08:19,120 --> 01:08:21,120
