1449
01:08:21,120 --> 01:08:23,120
It's the color of your spleen.

1450
01:08:23,120 --> 01:08:24,120
But your heart also

1451
01:08:24,120 --> 01:08:26,120
beats with tenderness.

1452
01:08:26,120 --> 01:08:28,120
The love of your ancestors is there.

1453
01:08:28,120 --> 01:08:31,120
Oh, I do not understand.

1454
01:08:31,120 --> 01:08:32,120
Are you high or something?

1455
01:08:32,120 --> 01:08:33,120
Well,

1456
01:08:34,120 --> 01:08:38,120
If somebody has hurt and his hurt gives you pain,

1457
01:08:38,120 --> 01:08:42,120
or if somebody has joy and his joy gives you pleasure,

1458
01:08:42,120 --> 01:08:43,120
that's love.

1459
01:08:43,120 --> 01:08:45,120
There's a booger blowing in and out of your nose.

1460
01:08:45,120 --> 01:08:46,120
Adele,

1461
01:08:46,120 --> 01:08:48,120
do you believe as your king believes

1462
01:08:48,120 --> 01:08:50,120
