1487
01:09:38,120 --> 01:09:40,120
We do not want unnecessary bloodshed.

1488
01:09:40,120 --> 01:09:41,120
We need the beasts.

1489
01:09:41,120 --> 01:09:43,120
But with your cylinder of fire,

1490
01:09:43,120 --> 01:09:44,120
