1491
01:09:44,120 --> 01:09:45,120
Oh, I thank you.

1492
01:09:45,120 --> 01:09:46,120
Oh, you mean the flashlight.

1493
01:09:46,120 --> 01:09:47,120
Okay.

1494
01:09:47,120 --> 01:09:50,120
We will not take part in any plan to punish your slaves.

1495
01:09:50,120 --> 01:09:53,120
Actually, I was kind of looking forward to that, John.

1496
01:09:53,120 --> 01:09:55,120
They are against us.

1497
01:09:55,120 --> 01:09:57,120
They are evil.

1498
01:09:57,120 --> 01:09:58,120
