1502
01:10:04,120 --> 01:10:06,120
And we will have their power.

1503
01:10:06,120 --> 01:10:07,120
No, Elinor.

1504
01:10:07,120 --> 01:10:09,120
We will not challenge Ishtar.

1505
01:10:09,120 --> 01:10:11,120
Oh, fool.

1506
01:10:11,120 --> 01:10:13,120
Have the gods arrest three of the beasts

1507
01:10:13,120 --> 01:10:15,120
and beat them until they are dead.

1508
01:10:15,120 --> 01:10:19,120
Oh, Pilate's favorite.

1509
01:10:19,120 --> 01:10:21,120
What I wouldn't give to be spat upon.

1510
01:10:21,120 --> 01:10:25,120
This is unpleasant.

1511
01:10:25,120 --> 01:10:27,120
Just pretend it's Adam Sandler.

1512
01:10:27,120 --> 01:10:29,120
Suddenly it's the same.

1513
01:10:29,120 --> 01:10:30,120
Suddenly it's great.

1514
01:10:30,120 --> 01:10:33,120
And that's for Billy Madison.

1515
01:10:33,120 --> 01:10:37,120
Let's melt some elves.

1516
01:10:37,120 --> 01:10:40,120
They make the French army look stalwart.

1517
01:10:40,120 --> 01:10:42,120
Come on, plenty of decel for everybody.

1518
01:10:42,120 --> 01:10:45,120
No, this makes my dress hurt.

1519
01:10:45,120 --> 01:10:49,120
The fire of Ishtar.

1520
01:10:49,120 --> 01:10:51,120
And so are we.

1521
01:10:51,120 --> 01:10:54,120
As long as they think we're armed, they'll stay away from us.

1522
01:10:54,120 --> 01:10:56,120
Walk this way and look like you've got batteries.

1523
01:10:56,120 --> 01:10:58,120
Come on, help me with these chains.

1524
01:10:58,120 --> 01:10:59,120
You're gonna release them?

1525
01:10:59,120 --> 01:11:01,120
We can't leave them here.

1526
01:11:01,120 --> 01:11:03,120
They attacked us the last time.

1527
01:11:03,120 --> 01:11:04,120
The guards forced them to.

1528
01:11:04,120 --> 01:11:07,120
The guards are the John Brown of the mole people.

1529
01:11:07,120 --> 01:11:10,120
So we're in the Green Giants' protective cop on their backs.

1530
01:11:10,120 --> 01:11:13,120
Go.

1531
01:11:13,120 --> 01:11:16,120
You're welcome.

1532
01:11:16,120 --> 01:11:20,120
Hey, thanks you guys.

1533
01:11:20,120 --> 01:11:23,120
If you ever need any earthworms or tunnels, you just let me know.

1534
01:11:25,120 --> 01:11:29,120
Oh, uh, me and the other moles we went in on a little gift for.

1535
01:11:29,120 --> 01:11:36,120
Well, any profound insights, John?

1536
01:11:36,120 --> 01:11:39,120
They're really jello mold men.

1537
01:11:39,120 --> 01:11:43,120
May your holes be long and deep.

1538
01:11:43,120 --> 01:11:45,120
He was trying to say something.

1539
01:11:45,120 --> 01:11:46,120
Yeah, I think it was...

1540
01:11:46,120 --> 01:11:50,120
They don't have the power of speech, but they can read.

1541
