01:12:47,580 --> 01:12:49,580
What does that indicate about?

1553
01:12:49,580 --> 01:12:53,580
Well, it looks to me like you just held the camera out at arm's length and took the picture yourself.

1554
01:12:53,580 --> 01:12:55,580
Another possibility, yes.

